WEBVTT

00:01:58.417 --> 00:02:02.018
the interactions
with the reproductive system

00:02:02.042 --> 00:02:05.851
are crucial for brain aging in women.

00:02:05.875 --> 00:02:08.643
These interactions
are mediated by our hormones.

00:02:08.667 --> 00:02:12.643
And we know that hormones differ
between the genders.

00:02:12.667 --> 00:02:16.226
Men have more testosterone,
women have more estrogens.

00:02:16.250 --> 00:02:17.684
But what really matters here

00:02:17.708 --> 00:02:21.393
is that these hormones differ
in their longevity.

00:02:21.417 --> 00:02:24.601
Men's testosterone doesn't run out
until late in life,

00:02:24.625 --> 00:02:29.476
which is a slow and pretty much
symptom-free process, of course.

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:33.018
(Laughter)